## 6. Fabric Comparison: Which Material Should You Choose?

| Fabric | Typical Appearance | Common Applications | Important Sourcing Check |
|---|---|---|---|
| Organza | Sheer and structured | Dupattas, sarees, sleeves | Stiffness and transparency |
| Georgette | Fluid and softly textured | Lehengas, anarkalis, sarees | Drape and embroidery weight |
| Banarasi Brocade | Decorative woven motifs | Jackets, blouses, lehengas | Motif repeat and usable width |
| Velvet | Dense, soft pile | Winter blouses, jackets | Pile direction and thickness |
| Tissue | Luminous and often crisp | Sarees, festive suits | Creasing and lining |

*Note: These are general characteristics. Actual fabric performance depends on fibre composition, weave, finish and embellishment.*

